						<<He>> moans, looking to you with pure ecstasy. "The feeling of you ruining me gets better every time. I belong to you, now and forever!" <<He>> holds on to you tightly. <<set $corruptionEvent to 1>><<npcincr Sydney purity -5>><<llspurity>>
